 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "What changed since the last map",
   "items": [
    "Universe is 120 symbols, 83 of them shares — every market the terminal offers, under the same 5%-of-ATR spread veto",
    "A scan can be started from the dashboard, and that button runs nothing but the research loop",
    "A fourth agent (jury) plus a database: the desk's answers survive the run that produced them"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "What the numbers mean",
   "items": [
    "10,128 cumulative trials; the bar is z 4.56 and is never recomputed per scan",
    "Best candidate today: SAN.ES donchian +0.308R, t 2.68 — it does not clear the bar",
    "150 to 360 tests per scan depending on the session's family count; STAND_DOWN is the expected answer"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "One write, and it cannot trade",
   "items": [
    "POST /api/scan takes no argument, so the button cannot run a configuration the scheduler does not",
    "Its only product is a stage in scan_progress.json — the UI reads it, the engine never knows",
    "Orders still need a human APPROVED and a single-use token; no path here reaches order_send"
   ]
  }
 ]
